## Scope boundary

State plainly what the system is **not**. Without this sentence, scope expands into the space where a wrong answer has consequences, and it expands quietly.

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| The system is | insight / decision support / system of record |
| Explicitly out of scope | |
| The agent may assemble evidence for, but never decide | |
| Enforced where | system prompt + write allow-list |
